---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../components/Eyebrow.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="Learn what information Landed Local collects through the free mockup form, how it is used, and how to request access or deletion."
>
  <Section bg="offwhite" class="privacy">
    <article class="privacy__content">
      <Eyebrow>Privacy</Eyebrow>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="privacy__effective">Effective date: October 27, 2026</p>

      <h2>What I collect</h2>
      <p>When you use the mockup form, I collect the information you enter: your name, business name, city, trade and email address, plus your phone number and current website if you choose to provide them. The form also records the page you sent it from, the referring site and any campaign tags in the link.</p>

      <h2>How I use it</h2>
      <p>I use your information only to build and send your free mockup and to follow up about it. I don't sell or rent personal information.</p>

      <h2>Who helps me</h2>
      <p>Web3Forms delivers form submissions to my email. The site is hosted on Replit. If I add HubSpot or website analytics later, I'll list them here.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>This site doesn't use advertising cookies.</p>

      <h2>How long I keep your information</h2>
      <p>I keep your information only as long as needed to prepare your mockup and follow up about it, then delete it unless I need to retain it for a legal or business record.</p>
      <p>You can ask to see or delete your information by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a> or calling or texting <a href={site.contact.phoneHref}>{site.contact.phoneDisplay}</a>.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, I'll update this page and its effective date.</p>

      <address>
        {site.business.legalName}<br />
        Columbus, Ohio<br />
        <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a><br />
        <a href={site.contact.phoneHref}>{site.contact.phoneDisplay}</a>
      </address>
    </article>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy__content { max-width: 760px; }
  .privacy__content h1 { margin: 0; }
  .privacy__effective { margin: var(--space) 0 calc(var(--space) * 4); color: var(--color-steel); }
  .privacy__content h2 { margin: calc(var(--space) * 4) 0 var(--space); font-size: var(--text-h2); }
  .privacy__content p { margin: 0; }
  .privacy__content p + p { margin-top: calc(var(--space) * 1.5); }
  .privacy__content a { color: var(--color-teal); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: var(--stroke-underline); text-underline-offset: var(--underline-offset); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .privacy__content address { margin-top: calc(var(--space) * 4); font-style: normal; line-height: var(--leading-body); }
</style>
